    <div class="alpheios-lex-entry" lemma-id="n94722" body-key=""><b><span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">σκευ-άριον</span></b> , τό, 
			Dim.
		
		<div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense2"><b>I.</b> (<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">σκεῦος</span>) <i>small vessel</i> or <i>utensil</i>, mostly
			in pl., <i><span class="en">
				Ar.
				<u>Ach.</u>
				451
			</span></i>, <i><span class="en">
				<u>Ra.</u>
				172
			</span></i>, <i><span class="en">
				<u>Pl.</u>
				809
			</span></i>, <i><span class="en">
				Pl.Com.
				121
			</span></i>, etc.: sg., <i><span class="en">
				Ar.
				<u>Pl.</u>
				1139
			</span></i>. </div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense3"><b>2.</b>
			<i>implements of gaming</i>, <i><span class="en">
				Aeschin.
				1.59
			</span></i>. </div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense2"><b>II.</b> (<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">σκευή</span>) <i>paltry garment</i>, <i><span class="en">
				Pl.
				<u>Alc.</u>
				1.113e
			</span></i>.</div>
    </div> <div class="alpheios-lex-footnotes en"> </div>
